---The engine configuration for the workgroup, which includes the minimum/maximum number of Data Processing Units (DPU) that queries should use when running in provisioned capacity. If not specified, Athena uses default values (Default value for min is 4 and for max is Minimum of 124 and allocated DPUs).
---@class aws.athena.EngineConfiguration
---@field CoordinatorDpuSize? aws.athena.CoordinatorDpuSize The number of DPUs to use for the coordinator. A coordinator is a special executor that orchestrates processing work and manages other executors in a notebook session. The default is 1.
---@field MaxConcurrentDpus? aws.athena.MaxConcurrentDpus The maximum number of DPUs that can run concurrently.
